---
// How ZeroEGGS works: two encoders feeding a frame-by-frame decoder.
// Plain HTML so it reflows to a vertical stack on phones.
---
<figure class="viz zd" aria-label="Diagram of ZeroEGGS: speech audio goes through a speech encoder, an example clip goes through a style encoder, and both feed a recurrent decoder that outputs full-body motion one frame at a time.">
  <div class="viz__head">
    <p class="viz__title">How ZeroEGGS works</p>
    <p class="viz__sub">Two encoders feed a decoder that writes the motion one frame at a time</p>
  </div>
  <div class="zd__grid">
    <div class="zd__in zd__in--speech">Speech audio</div>
    <div class="zd__arrow zd__a1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="zd__box zd__enc-speech">Speech encoder<small>1-D convolutions over the audio's spectrogram</small></div>

    <div class="zd__in zd__in--style">Example clip<small>any style, even one never seen in training</small></div>
    <div class="zd__arrow zd__a2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="zd__box zd__enc-style">Style encoder<small>attention, variational: a sampled 64-number style embedding</small></div>

    <div class="zd__arrow zd__a3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="zd__box zd__box--main zd__dec">Decoder<small>two-layer recurrent network (GRU); each new pose depends on the previous one</small><span class="zd__loop">↻ previous pose</span></div>
    <div class="zd__arrow zd__a4" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="zd__out">Full-body motion<small>75 joints including fingers, 60 frames per second</small></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="viz__caption">
    Sizes are from the released v1 model. Because the style embedding is sampled, the same speech and example
    can produce different but equally plausible gestures.
  </figcaption>
  <style>
    .zd__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 1.6rem minmax(0, 1.25fr) 1.6rem minmax(0, 1.35fr) 1.6rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: auto auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem 0;
    }
    .zd__in, .zd__box, .zd__out {
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .zd__in, .zd__out { background: var(--bg-deep); border: 1px dashed var(--border); }
    .zd__box { background: var(--viz-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
    .zd__box--main { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-from) 55%, var(--border)); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-from) 7%, var(--viz-surface)); }
    .zd__grid small { display: block; font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 0.2rem; }
    .zd__loop { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent-from); }
    .zd__arrow { position: relative; height: 2px; background: var(--axis); margin: 0 0.25rem; }
    .zd__arrow::after { content: ""; position: absolute; right: -1px; top: -4px; border: 5px solid transparent; border-left-color: var(--axis); border-right: 0; }

    .zd__in--speech { grid-area: 1 / 1; }  .zd__a1 { grid-area: 1 / 2; }  .zd__enc-speech { grid-area: 1 / 3; }
    .zd__in--style { grid-area: 2 / 1; }   .zd__a2 { grid-area: 2 / 2; }  .zd__enc-style { grid-area: 2 / 3; }
    .zd__a3 { grid-area: 1 / 4 / 3 / 5; }  .zd__dec { grid-area: 1 / 5 / 3 / 6; }
    .zd__a4 { grid-area: 1 / 6 / 3 / 7; }  .zd__out { grid-area: 1 / 7 / 3 / 8; }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .zd__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: none; gap: 0.5rem; }
      .zd__in--speech { grid-area: auto; } .zd__in--style { grid-area: auto; }
      .zd__enc-speech { grid-area: auto; } .zd__enc-style { grid-area: auto; }
      .zd__dec, .zd__out { grid-area: auto; grid-column: 1 / -1; }
      .zd__a1, .zd__a2, .zd__a4 { display: none; }
      .zd__a3 { grid-area: auto; grid-column: 1 / -1; height: 1.2rem; width: 2px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .zd__a3::after { right: auto; left: -4px; top: auto; bottom: -1px; border: 5px solid transparent; border-top-color: var(--axis); border-bottom: 0; }
      .zd__out::before { content: "↓"; display: block; text-align: center; color: var(--axis); margin: -0.4rem 0 0.2rem; }
    }
  </style>
</figure>
